================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This package contains no third-party code. Its one external dependency is
fetched at build time and is NOT redistributed here:

  libSBML 5.x -- GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1.
                 https://sbml.org/software/libsbml/
                 Downloaded and built by build-libsbml.sh, and linked
                 dynamically. Because it is neither bundled in this source
                 package nor statically linked, no LGPL redistribution
                 obligation attaches to this distribution. If you later ship
                 prebuilt binaries, keep the dynamic linkage: that is what
                 satisfies LGPL-2.1 section 6, by letting users relink against
                 their own copy of the library.

  GLUT / OpenGL -- system libraries, not distributed here. On macOS these are
                 Apple's GLUT.framework and OpenGL.framework; on Linux they are
                 typically freeglut and Mesa, installed by the user.
